<title>UK: Muenchen sets 100 milion mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Muenchen sets 100 milion mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESHAUPTSTADT MUENCHEN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    28.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.87     PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    *	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*BAVARIA REGULATEDMARKET</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
